@startuml
!include _style.puml
' 领域类图（三）：行为、诊断、简报 —— 概念层

class Learner {
  learnerId : String
  nickname : String
  pushPreference : PushFrequency
}
class CognitiveDiagnosis {
  diagnosisId : String
  pattern : String
  rootCause : String
  confidence : Double
  reasoningChain : List
  status : DiagnosisStatus
}
class LearningEvent {
  eventId : String
  kind : EventKind
  occurredAt : DateTime
  payload : Map
}
class Briefing {
  briefingId : String
  week : String
  topicDistribution : Map
  missingTopics : String[*]
  conflictTrend : Integer
}

Learner "1" -down-> "0..*" CognitiveDiagnosis : 获得
Learner "1" -down-> "0..*" LearningEvent : 产生
Learner "1" -down-> "0..*" Briefing : 接收
CognitiveDiagnosis ..> LearningEvent
Briefing ..> LearningEvent

CognitiveDiagnosis -[hidden]right- LearningEvent
LearningEvent -[hidden]right- Briefing

note bottom of Briefing
  简报按周动态生成、不单独落库，
  重复压制靠推送侧 content_hash 去重（ADR-07）。
  诊断与简报都是「派生」产物，故用虚线依赖。
end note

@enduml
